From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Gino D." <25200363+zinosaure@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:48:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] gameflex: the compile-only case list takes the wave
 reductions by table

Upstream 1e871718 turned ComputeWave64Reduction(masked, bitwise_or) into a reduction from
kWaveReductions; the three cases of --compile-only keep their meaning (minimum, masked minimum, or).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tests/ShaderRecompilerComputeTests.cpp | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tests/ShaderRecompilerComputeTests.cpp b/tests/ShaderRecompilerComputeTests.cpp
index 3c3924b4..f928c015 100644
--- a/tests/ShaderRecompilerComputeTests.cpp
+++ b/tests/ShaderRecompilerComputeTests.cpp
@@ -57346,9 +57346,9 @@ int main(int argc, char **argv) {
         [] { return BufferAtomicAddX2GlcAndExec(); },
         [] { return BufferAtomicUMinX2GlcAndExec(); },
         [] { return Vop3pIntegerNegationCapturedAndSelectedHalves(); },
-        [] { return ComputeWave64Reduction(false, false); },
-        [] { return ComputeWave64Reduction(true, false); },
-        [] { return ComputeWave64Reduction(false, true); },
+        [] { return ComputeWave64Reduction(kWaveMinimum); },
+        [] { return ComputeWave64Reduction(kWaveMinimum, true); },
+        [] { return ComputeWave64Reduction(kWaveReductions[1]); },
         [] { return VectorDpp8Captured(false); },
         [] { return VectorDppQuadPermuteReverse(); },
         [] { return VectorDppRowXmask(); },
